      },
      "content_hash": "c62b491f356f30138b65c60750c897221d5c0e0d988b17e0dc68e1df7b88ddd5"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "doc_ab6bd50ab85c2abe_chunk_5",
      "document_id": "doc_ab6bd50ab85c2abe",
      "document_name": "sample_document.md",
      "content": "RAG 系统支持多种文档格式的解析：\n- PDF 文档：支持横排和竖排文字、表格、图表标题提取\n- Word 文档（. docx, . doc）：保留文档结构和格式\n- 纯文本文件（. txt）：支持多种编码自动检测\n- Markdown 文件（. md, . markdown）：解析标题、表格、代码块等元素",
      "chunk_index": 5,
      "start_position": 145,
      "end_position": 300,
      "token_count": 117,
      "element_type": "paragraph",
      "page_number": null,
      "metadata": {
        "text_direction": "horizontal"
      },
      "content_hash": "0877bdc2c8c79f665acecbd07c3f33b217b0dead881ec969c765d33a04ce69fe"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "doc_ab6bd50ab85c2abe_chunk_6",
      "document_id": "doc_ab6bd50ab85c2abe",
      "document_name": "sample_document.md",
      "content": "2. 文本分块策略",
      "chunk_index": 6,
      "start_position": 295,
      "end_position": 304,
      "token_count": 11,
      "element_type": "heading",
      "page_number": null,
      "metadata": {
        "level": 3,
        "text_direction": "horizontal"
      },
      "content_hash": "35572d0b934402b8d8ac0b50cd3fd176e44c700c6660ccb8bad556094e5acd4c"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "doc_ab6bd50ab85c2abe_chunk_7",
      "document_id": "doc_ab6bd50ab85c2abe",
      "document_name": "sample_document.md",
      "content": "分块策略是 RAG 系统的关键环节：\n- 可配置大小：默认 512 tokens，可根据需求调整\n- 句子边界保护：避免在句子中间切分，保持语义完整性\n- 重叠机制：相邻块之间有 50 tokens 的重叠，确保上下文连贯\n- 表格特殊处理：表格按行分组，表头重复出现在每个分块中",
      "chunk_index": 7,
      "start_position": 304,
      "end_position": 444,
      "token_count": 134,
      "element_type": "paragraph",
      "page_number": null,
      "metadata": {
        "text_direction": "horizontal"
      },
      "content_hash": "e6aa51fc16586972a968849e1b79584f218352175b1ba19801ca4e763e0cd5df"
    },
